<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center px-1">
  <%# Hero Section %>
  <div class="py-10 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mb-6 sm:mb-8">
      <span class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl inline-block pulse-glow neon-text-pink">♪</span>
      <span class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl inline-block pulse-glow mx-2 sm:mx-3 neon-text-cyan" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">♫</span>
      <span class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl inline-block pulse-glow neon-text-purple" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;">♬</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold mb-4 sm:mb-6">
      <span class="neon-text-cyan">Hit</span><span class="neon-text-pink">Guessr</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-400 mb-8 sm:mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed px-2">
      Le jeu de devinettes musicales entre amis ! Proposez vos morceaux préférés et devinez qui a choisi quoi.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 sm:gap-5 justify-center px-4 sm:px-0">
      <%= link_to "S'inscrire", new_user_registration_path, class: "btn-neon btn-primary text-white font-semibold py-3 sm:py-4 px-8 sm:px-12 rounded-lg text-base sm:text-lg transition-all duration-300 min-h-11" %>
      <%= link_to "Se connecter", new_user_session_path, class: "btn-neon bg-dark-800 font-semibold py-3 sm:py-4 px-8 sm:px-12 rounded-lg text-base sm:text-lg border border-neon-cyan/40 hover:border-neon-cyan transition-all duration-300 neon-text-cyan min-h-11" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# How it works %>
  <div class="py-10 sm:py-16 border-t border-neon-purple/15">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold neon-text-cyan mb-8 sm:mb-12">Comment ça marche ?</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <div class="neon-border p-6 sm:p-8 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-3 sm:mb-4 inline-block">👥</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold neon-text-pink mb-2 sm:mb-3">1. Créez votre équipe</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">Invitez vos amis à rejoindre votre équipe pour jouer ensemble.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="neon-border p-6 sm:p-8 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-3 sm:mb-4 inline-block">🎶</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold neon-text-cyan mb-2 sm:mb-3">2. Proposez un morceau</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">Chaque joueur soumet secrètement un lien YouTube vers sa chanson.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="neon-border p-6 sm:p-8 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-3 sm:mb-4 inline-block">🤔</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold neon-text-purple mb-2 sm:mb-3">3. Devinez !</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">Écoutez les morceaux et devinez qui a proposé chaque chanson.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# Scoring %>
  <div class="py-10 sm:py-16 border-t border-neon-purple/15">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold neon-text-pink mb-8 sm:mb-12">Système de points</h2>
    <div class="neon-border p-6 sm:p-10 max-w-lg mx-auto">
      <div class="space-y-6 sm:space-y-8 text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center">
          <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mr-4 sm:mr-5 flex-shrink-0">🎯</span>
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg neon-text-cyan">+1 point</span>
            <span class="text-gray-400 text-base sm:text-lg"> pour chaque bonne devinette</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center">
          <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mr-4 sm:mr-5 flex-shrink-0">🛡️</span>
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg neon-text-pink">+1 point</span>
            <span class="text-gray-400 text-base sm:text-lg"> quand personne ne devine votre morceau</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# Call to action %>
  <div class="py-10 sm:py-16 border-t border-neon-purple/15">
    <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-400 mb-6 sm:mb-8">Prêt à jouer ?</p>
    <%= link_to "Commencer maintenant", new_user_registration_path, class: "btn-neon btn-primary text-white font-semibold py-3 sm:py-4 px-8 sm:px-12 rounded-lg text-lg sm:text-xl transition-all duration-300 inline-block min-h-11" %>
  </div>
</div>
